          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Shifting dullness and fluid thrill present; mild diffuse tenderness. No rebound or guarding and no focal RUQ/RIF signs. Liver edge not felt. Small reducible umbilical hernia."
      }
